//substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:56,&quot;width&quot;:56,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:5859,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/164561611?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jAJ6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faa6a28f5-efe2-4efb-93bc-87d726ddd0ec_56x56.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p><strong>Recomienda Think &amp; Hacks</strong></p><p>Como responsable de IA generativa en Editorial Planeta, mi trabajo no es implementar IA.</p><p><strong>Es evitar que mi empresa pierda dinero implementando IA mal.</strong></p><p>La diferencia entre ambas cosas es exactamente lo que encontrarás aquí: <strong>la brecha entre lo que Silicon Valley promete y lo que realmente funciona cuando tienes 500 empleados, sistemas legacy, y un margen que defender.</strong> Por qué la mayoría de estrategias de IA están diseñadas para fracasar (spoiler: porque son estrategias de consultoría, no de negocio), y cómo las pocas que funcionan pueden mover tu P&amp;L sin dinamitar tu operación.</p><p><strong>Otra mirada a la tecnología. La de quien la implementa, no la vende.</strong></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p>",
